  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]Can you remember\nremember my name\n[G]\nAs I flow through your life\n[D]\nA thousand oceans I have\n[G]flown\n[A7]\nAnd cold spirits of ice\nAll my life\nI am the echo of your past\n[D]\n[G]\n[D]I am returning\nthe echo of a point in time\n[G]\nDistant faces shine\n[D]\nA thousand warriors I have\n[G]known\n[A7]And laughing\nas the spirits appear\nAll your life\nShadows of another day\nAnd\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]\n[C]if you hear me talking on\n[Dm]the wind You've got to\n[G]understand We\n[Dm]must remain Perfect\n[C]Strangers\n[G]\n[Gm]\n\n[Instrumental]\n[Am]\nI know I\nmust remain inside this silent well of\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]sorrow\n[G]\n[D]A strand of silver\nhanging through the\n[G]sky\nTouching more than you see\n[A7]\nThe voice of ages in your mind\nIs aching\nwith the dead of the night\nPrecious life\nyour tears are lost in falling\nrain\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]\n[C]And if you hear me talking\n[Dm]on the wind 67You've got to\n[G]understand We\n[Dm]must remain Perfect\n[C]Strangers\n[G]\n[Gm]\n\n[Outro]\n[Am]",
